The stock-to-v36 workflow bundles unchanged NikonFirmwarePatch v0.3.0-r1 and
v0.4.0-rc.2 public toolkit archives, and research/z8-live/nfp-builder/ adapts
upstream NikonFirmwarePatch v0.5.1 (25fefa1) for V71.7-r7 CLI toolkit and macOS
app compatibility. Their source, macOS builder and compiled patch units retain
GPL-3.0-only and the upstream LICENSE/NOTICE.md enclosed in each directory or
archive. They are outside the Fenestra license and additional photography
permission. See research/z8-live/from-stock/third-party/README.md and
research/z8-live/nfp-builder/NOTICE.md for identities and provenance.

